  "instructions": [
    "In a small pan, heat the olive oil over medium heat.",
    "Add the diced onion and sauté until translucent, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for an additional 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "Add the smoked paprika, ground cumin, salt, and black pepper, and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the dried raisins and dashi extract, and cook for 2-3 minutes, until the raisins are rehydrated.",
    "Stir in the chopped fresh cilantro and lemon juice.",
    "Serve hot over rice or with naan bread.",
    "Garnish with additional cilantro, if desired."
